      "description": "Pill search with soft lift, used on Search and Map.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg><input placeholder=\"Search places\"></label>",
      "css": ":host{--p:#2350D9;--p-strong:#16348F;--on-p:#fff;--pc:#DBE4FF;--on-pc:#0E2266;--bg:#EEF2FF;--surface:#fff;--surface-2:#E6ECFF;--ink:#10183A;--ink-2:#46507A;--ink-3:#5C668C;--line:#D9E0F7;--good:#17703E;--good-bg:#DDF2E4;--ok:#845300;--ok-bg:#FBEFD2;--bad:#A8301F;--bad-bg:#FADFDB;font-family:Nunito,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-search{width:320px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 18px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(20,30,50,.06),0 8px 20px -14px rgba(20,30,50,.3);color:var(--ink-2)}.ds-search input{border:0;outline:none;flex:1;background:transparent;font:600 15.5px Nunito,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--ink-3)}.ds-search:focus-within{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--p),0 8px 20px -14px rgba(20,30,50,.3)}"
